#  Pizza Sales Analysis: SQL Exploratory Data Analysis

An end-to-end EDA of one year of pizza restaurant sales (2015) using **MySQL**. The project answers ten business questions on orders, revenue, product mix and customer timing, then turns the results into recommendations.

